sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Customer (voice)
    participant B as BimpeAI Agent
    participant F as BFF (holds key)
    participant S as Stripe TEST
    participant O as Confirmation<br/>Orchestrator
    participant G as Gmail MCP
    participant W as WhatsApp
    participant D as Dashboard

    Note over U,D: t0 armed on first utterance
    U->>B: "This jacket doesn't fit, refund order 1024"
    B->>B: Reason over seeded KB<br/>(Ada · order #1024 · £42)
    B-->>F: webhook: agent.reasoning / tool.called
    F-->>D: SSE → reasoning trail fills

    B->>S: issue_refund (£42)
    S-->>B: refund object (re_...)
    B-->>F: webhook: refund.issued
    F-->>D: SSE refund.confirmed → Refund card GREEN

    F->>O: runConfirmations(ctx)
    par Parallel fan-out
        O->>G: send confirmation email
        G-->>O: email.sent
        O-->>D: SSE → Email card GREEN
    and
        O->>W: send WhatsApp (via BimpeAI)
        W-->>O: whatsapp.sent
        O-->>D: SSE → WhatsApp card GREEN
    end

    Note over D: STOP timer →<br/>"Refunded + confirmed in ~40s"
